                                                "sense_id": "866d8ecf-9697-3f23-808c-c3b0bd4f2388",
                                                "text": "Before he could bring it down, the pager clipped to his belt went off. […] If you were a lawyer or a business executive, maybe you could afford to ignore your pages for a while, but when you were a County Sheriff—and one who was elected rather than appointed—there wasn't much question about priorities."
                                            },
